===============================================================================
Test fixture corpus (test support only, never shipped)
===============================================================================

The module da-log-fixtures holds anonymised excerpts of open datasets as test
fixtures. It is a test dependency only: no service ships it. Identifiers in the
excerpts (account numbers, addresses, e-mail addresses, project and tenant ids)
are replaced by com.dlap.fixtures.anon.Anonymiser, and each case records its
source repository, commit, licence and date in its meta.yaml.

  invictus-ir/aws_dataset                         MIT
  panther-labs/panther-analysis                   Apache-2.0
  GoogleCloudPlatform/professional-services       Apache-2.0
  googleapis/google-cloudevents                   Apache-2.0
  open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib  Apache-2.0

The notices for each source, with copyright lines and the MIT licence text, are
in da-log-fixtures/src/main/resources/dlap-fixtures/<family>/NOTICE.md, joined
at build time into META-INF/dlap-fixtures-NOTICE.md of the module's jar.
